<Publisher title="Delivery & reader support — Scale of Us"><section class="page-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">READER SUPPORT</p><h1>A little help,<br /><em>before you begin.</em></h1></section><div class="prose-layout wrap"><aside><a href="#reading">Reading & listening</a><a href="#delivery">Delivery</a><a href="#privacy">Reviews & privacy</a></aside><article><section id="reading"><h2>Reading & listening</h2><p>Online reading is free. Choose English or Spanish and move at your own pace. For immersive reading, open the reader and press Listen. You can pause and choose a chapter.</p><p>If audio doesn’t start, press Listen again after checking your device’s sound settings. The text remains available while playback is paused.</p></section><section id="delivery"><h2>The printed edition</h2><p>The first printing contains 100 copies. Copies for sale, gifts, reviewers, and award submissions will be allocated before the shop opens.</p><p class="local-notice">Local proposal: shipping destinations, rates, dispatch times, taxes, returns, damaged-copy handling, and a publisher contact are still to be agreed. Checkout is a demonstration and takes no payment.</p></section><section id="privacy"><h2>Reviews & privacy</h2><p>A reviewer chooses their public name and the experience they’re reviewing. Contact details are private. Reviews from complimentary-copy recipients and readers who know the author carry those disclosures.</p><p>This local preview saves only a test review draft in your browser. It discards the email field and sends nothing to a server. You can delete the draft from the review form.</p><p>Before the live review form opens, we’ll publish the privacy notice, explain review moderation, and connect email verification and storage. Positive and critical reviews will follow the same moderation rules.</p></section></article></div></Publisher>
